    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing i'm worried about is the \"friction\" aspect. specifically, how much turbulence or unpredictable stopping occurs during peak merging periods. is there a way to quantify that friction or does it just become a chaotic variable in the model?",
